# Ministry Brands

> Ministry Brands is the leading provider of church management software (ChMS), Catholic parish management software, nonprofit donor CRM, and faith-based background screening in North America. The company serves 90,000+ purpose-driven organizations: 55,000+ Protestant churches, 9,000+ Catholic parishes, 185+ arch/dioceses, and 35,000+ ministries using background screening. Headquartered in Milton, Georgia. CEO: Chris Bacon. Founded: 2012 (holding company); core products carry 25–40+ year individual histories. B2B SaaS. Primary markets: United States and Canada.

**Primary products:** Ministry Brands Amplify (ChMS), ParishSOFT (Catholic parish software), DonorDirect (nonprofit donor CRM), Protect My Ministry (church background checks), Shield Screening (commercial background checks).

**Investors:** Reverence Capital Partners, Insight Partners. **Employees:** ~700.

