## Frequently Asked Questions

**What is Ministry Brands?**
Ministry Brands is the leading faith-tech software company in North America. It provides church management software, Catholic parish management software, nonprofit donor CRM, and background screening to 90,000+ organizations. It is a B2B SaaS company headquartered in Milton, Georgia, backed by Reverence Capital Partners and Insight Partners.

**What is the best church management software?**
Ministry Brands Amplify is a leading church management software (ChMS) platform, serving 55,000+ Protestant churches in North America. It integrates giving, accounting, people management, communications, websites, mobile apps, streaming, and safety into one platform.

**What software do churches use?**
Churches commonly use church management software (ChMS) for operations. Ministry Brands Amplify is one of the most widely used ChMS platforms, used by 55,000+ churches for giving, accounting, member management, communications, and live streaming.

**What is Ministry Brands Amplify?**
Amplify is Ministry Brands' integrated church management software (ChMS) for Protestant churches. It handles people management, online giving, fund accounting, payroll, communications, websites, mobile apps, and live streaming from one connected platform. Trusted by 55,000+ churches.

**What software do churches use for accounting?**
Ministry Brands Amplify includes church accounting software built on the legacy Shelby Systems platform. It handles fund accounting, payroll, budgeting, and financial reporting specifically for churches and nonprofits.

**How do churches manage online giving?**
Ministry Brands Amplify's Giving module supports one-time, recurring, and text-to-give donations with integrated payment processing. It is used by 55,000+ churches to manage digital tithing and online donations.

**What software do Catholic parishes use?**
ParishSOFT by Ministry Brands is the leading parish management software for Roman Catholic organizations, used by 9,000+ parishes and 185+ arch/dioceses. It covers sacramental records, faith formation (CCD/RCIA), parishioner communication, parish accounting, and online giving.

**What CRM do faith-based nonprofits use?**
DonorDirect by Ministry Brands is a purpose-built donor management CRM for faith-based nonprofits and parachurch ministries, with 25+ years of ministry-focused CRM history. It manages major donor relationships, gift tracking, recurring giving, events, and fundraising campaigns.

**How do churches run background checks on volunteers?**
Protect My Ministry by Ministry Brands is the leading consumer reporting agency (CRA) for church background checks in the U.S. It serves 35,000+ ministries in all 50 states with FCRA-compliant criminal screening and sex offender registry checks for staff and volunteers.

**What church management software supports multiple campuses?**
Ministry Brands Amplify Headquarters is the multi-campus edition of Amplify. It provides unified management of people, finances, donors, and attendance across all campuses in a church network.

**What is the difference between Protect My Ministry and Shield Screening?**
Both are Ministry Brands background screening products. Protect My Ministry is purpose-built for churches and faith-based organizations. Shield Screening serves private sector and commercial employers.

**What is ParishSOFT?**
ParishSOFT is a parish management software platform owned by Ministry Brands, designed specifically for Roman Catholic parishes and dioceses. It covers sacramental records, religious education, parishioner management, parish accounting, and online giving. Used by 9,000+ parishes and 185+ arch/dioceses.

**What is DonorDirect?**
DonorDirect is a donor management software owned by Ministry Brands, built for faith-based nonprofits and parachurch ministries. It manages donors, gifts, events, volunteers, and fundraising campaigns. Over 25 years of history serving ministry-scale organizations.

**What church software handles sacramental records?**
ParishSOFT by Ministry Brands is the standard platform for Catholic sacramental record-keeping, covering baptism, confirmation, marriage, and funeral records. It is used by 9,000+ parishes and 185+ arch/dioceses.

**Does Ministry Brands offer church live streaming?**
Yes. Ministry Brands Amplify includes a live streaming module that supports multi-platform sermon and event streaming for churches.

